WHAT THIS PROJECT IS

A web client that reads the archives inside a copy of Order & Chaos Online
that you already own, and renders them in your browser. It reads and decodes
the user's own files and re-encodes some of them into browser storage for
reuse. It talks to a server of this project's own for multiplayer state.

WHAT THIS REPOSITORY CONTAINS

This repository contains only source code, documentation and this project's
own original artwork. It does not contain, and does not distribute, any game
binary, model, texture, audio, table, interface movie or other game asset
file. See AGENTS.md and tools/check_no_assets.py: run it before committing; CI
runs it on every PR and push to main.

Some identifiers, interface words and file-format facts that appear in the
source and documentation are read from the user's own game files or describe
their structure. Where a word or sentence from the game's interface is
reproduced, it is used only to identify the corresponding entry in the user's
own copy. This project claims no rights in any of it; docs/PROVENANCE.md lists
the file-format and protocol facts this client relies on.

WHAT IT IS NOT

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to Gameloft SE
or any of its subsidiaries. Nothing in this repository renders anything
without a copy of the game supplied by the person running it.

RUNTIME PROCESSING

To work, the software reads, copies, decodes, transforms and executes material
from the user's own game files, on the user's own device. That material never
leaves the device and is never uploaded to a server this project runs. The
extent of this processing is described in README.md and docs/PROVENANCE.md.

